## 7. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS

**Q: I'm a startup with no revenue yet. Which license applies?**
A: If you intend to generate revenue, the commercial license applies. Contact
sekacorn@gmail.com to arrange deferred payment terms until revenue generation.

**Q: Can I negotiate the 4% rate?**
A: Custom terms are available for large enterprises, strategic partnerships,
or unique use cases. Contact sekacorn@gmail.com to discuss.

**Q: What if I only use a small part of the Software?**
A: The 4% applies to gross revenue from any product/service utilizing the
Software, regardless of the extent of use.

**Q: Can I purchase a perpetual license instead of revenue sharing?**
A: Yes, perpetual licenses are available upon request. Contact sekacorn@gmail.com
for pricing.

**Q: How do I prove I'm a non-profit?**
A: Provide 501(c)(3) documentation or equivalent non-profit registration to
sekacorn@gmail.com to confirm eligibility for the MIT license.

**Q: What happens if I don't report revenue accurately?**
A: Licensor has audit rights. Underpayment of 5%+ will result in reimbursement
of audit costs, payment of outstanding amounts with interest, and potential
license termination and legal action.

